{#-
  Arista EOS -- NAC on access ports.

  ============================ REVIEW THIS BLOCK ============================
  Generic EOS 802.1X, not your standard, and less certain than the IOS block:
  confirm the keywords against your EOS release before trusting the audit.
  ===========================================================================

  Same two modes as the IOS template: `declare` emits the required block, and
  otherwise it emits `interface X` plus only the lines that port lacks.
-#}
{% if declare %}
switchport mode access
dot1x pae authenticator
dot1x port-control auto
dot1x reauthentication
dot1x timeout tx-period 7
dot1x mac based authentication
spanning-tree portfast
spanning-tree bpduguard enable
{% else %}
{% for name in add %}
interface {{ name }}
{% for line in missing[name] %}
 {{ line }}
{% endfor %}
{% endfor %}
{% endif %}
